message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "TextMapReady Words: bibliometric text mining for VOSviewer co-occurrence networks"
abstract: "Browser-based tool (formerly PDFWords) that extracts words from PDF, Word and text files and exports a VOSviewer co-occurrence network in JSON. Files are processed locally and never uploaded."
